\p{State and prove the required restriction/unit and formal-theory comparisons. Develop coherently in the root, using discrete comparisons early; optional homotopy-equipment routes require their own established bridge. Prove \ref{at-ft-0001}/2/3/5/6/7. \ref{at-ft-0008}'s former general claim is retired. Construct the span recipe with its actual indexing and relative boundaries as far as its dependencies permit; \ref{at-sp-0004} must pass before export. \ref{at-ft-0004}'s full double-∞ comparison may follow at \ref{ms-0006} if necessary.}
\p{\strong{Exit:} every exported formal theorem has the stated hypotheses and its discrete test. \strong{Freeze:} the proved equipment/units definitions and formal theorem signatures.}
